    "只修改 Standard 基础价。Fast 与长上下文价格按 Codex 规则生成，并同步到所有费用。手工基础价在自动同步后保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit Standard base prices only. Fast and long-context prices are derived using Codex rules and applied to all cost estimates. Manual base prices survive automatic synchronization."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只修改 Standard 基础价。Fast 与长上下文价格按 Codex 规则生成，并同步到所有费用。手工基础价在自动同步后保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只显示服务端已提供的重置明细": {
