      }
    },
    "只记录个人资料，不会变更实际订阅或产生扣款。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Personal records only; this does not change your subscription or create a charge."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只记录个人资料，不会变更实际订阅或产生扣款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可检测 Responses 上游实际返回的模型型号。该功能只把当前模型服务地址临时改为本机回环代理，退出时恢复；需要生效或无法确认时，可选择现在重启 Codex 客户端或稍后自行重启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Observes model names returned by Responses. Temporarily routes the current provider through a local relay and restores it on exit. You can restart Codex now or reopen it later to apply changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可检测 Responses 上游实际返回的模型型号。该功能只把当前模型服务地址临时改为本机回环代理，退出时恢复；需要生效或无法确认时，可选择现在重启 Codex 客户端或稍后自行重启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
