          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按主请求发起时间统计；关联子代理不重复计入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按主请求发起时间统计；关联子代理不重复计入，未归属调用不计为用户请求。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Counted by the main request start time; related subagents are not counted again, and unassigned calls are not user requests."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按主请求发起时间统计；关联子代理不重复计入，未归属调用不计为用户请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按各轮实际处理时间合计，不包含等待用户答复的间隔；并行子代理不重复相加。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Total active time across turns, excluding idle time waiting for user replies; parallel subagents are not added twice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按各轮实际处理时间合计，不包含等待用户答复的间隔；并行子代理不重复相加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
